dekerksplein、Oudezijds Achterburgwal","lat":52.37468,"lng":4.89805,"measures":"2020年起導覽團需許可；2024年1月1日起7.5噸以上遊覽車未經許可不得進入S100內環，首年重型遊覽車減少66%。","observe":"人流引導標誌；上午人潮少，可清楚觀察街道斷面與運河岸配置。","flag":"","sources":[["Mobiliteit.nl：Touringcarmaatregel","https://www.mobiliteit.nl/contractvervoer/2025/02/12/minder-zware-touringcars-in-centrum-amsterdam-na-maatregel/"]],"kind":"stop"},{"time":"10:10–10:40","types":["4.2"],"name":"Dam → Kalverstraat","lat":52.36784,"lng":4.89186,"measures":"購物行人街區，設有貨車裝卸時窗。","observe":"裝卸時窗結束前之配送行為；行人街入口管制。","flag":"","sources":[],"kind":"stop"},{"time":"10:40–11:00","types":["4.1"],"name":"Rokin → Muntplein","lat":52.3684,"lng":4.89284,"measures":"北南線地鐵完工後以「Rode Loper」計畫改造：減少汽車車道、沿水岸設寬闊步道、電車居中。","observe":"步道與剩餘車道之斷面比例；地鐵出入口與步行空間整合。","flag":"完工年份待確認。","sources":[["Straatbeeld：Rode Loper Rokin","https://www.straatbeeld.nl/nieuws/rode-loper-amsterdam-van-start-op-rokin-en-muntplein"]],"kind":"stop"},{"time":"11:15–11:50","types":["4.5"],"name":"Weesperstraat、Roetersstraat（Dr. Sarphatihuis）","lat":52.3647,"lng":4.91055,"measures":"Weesperstraat由4車道縮減為2車道、時速50降為30公里，為監測中之試行配置，最終設計預計2027年定案。Sarphatihuis（Amsta照護機構）：阿姆斯特丹大學placemaking計畫試設臨時斑馬線與座椅，建議永久化並降低緣石。","observe":"道路瘦身試行配置；照護機構前之穿越條件與綠地可及性；建議是否已施作。","flag":"","sources":[["Gemeente Amsterdam：Weesperstraat","https://www.amsterdam.nl/projecten/weesperstraat/plannen/"],["UvA Placemaking：Sarphatihuis","https://placemakingamsterdam.nl/partners/dr.-sarphatihuis/plantsoen-sarphatihuis-en-de-roetersstraat"]],"kind":"stop"},{"time":"12:10–12:45","types":["4.6"],"name":"Frans Halsbuurt（De Pijp）","lat":52.35717,"lng":4.88883,"measures":"2018年兩場參與會議及1,845戶問卷，最高期望為增加綠化（53%）與座椅（22%）；約600格路邊停車移除，居民改停Albert Cuyp地下停車場；2022年秋起改造，設50處以上雨水花園並植樹。","observe":"無路邊停車之街道斷面；雨水花園與綠化；裝卸格位；地下停車場出入口。","flag":"需確認已完工。","sources":[["Gemeente Amsterdam：Frans Halsbuurt","https://www.amsterdam.nl/projecten/franshalsbuurt/"]],"kind":"stop"},{"time":"12:45–13:15","types":[],"name":"午餐：Albert Cuyp市場","lat":52.35523,"lng":4.89178,"measures":"","observe":"","flag":"","sources":[],"kind":"meal"},{"time":"13:30–13:50","types":["4.3"],"name":"Nicolaas Maesstraat（Nicolaas Maesschool）","lat":52.35407,"lng":4.87571,"measures":"上下學時段封街約30分鐘，並保留3格貨運自行車停車位。阿姆斯特丹現有約15條schoolstraat，目標每年增加約10條。","observe":"封街設施與標誌；貨運自行車停車位；校門口空間。星期三約12:00–12:30放學，此時段以空間觀察為主。","flag":"需向學校確認封街時間。","sources":[["Bike City Amsterdam：School streets","http://bikecity.amsterdam.nl/en/more-and-more-school-streets-in-amsterdam/"]],"kind":"stop"},{"time":"13:50–14:10","types":[],"name":"電車 → Amsterdam Zuid，轉NS返回烏特勒支","lat":52.33881,"lng":4.87319,"measures":"","observe":"","flag":"","sources":[],"kind":"hub"}]}]}